      "releaseNotes": "• Record a find as often as you like. Each find is saved with its date, and your logbook groups them under each mushroom.\n• Finds from a photo are dated the day the photo was taken.\n• Optionally save where you found it. You're asked once and can change this in Settings.\n• Choose up to three photos from your gallery at once for a photo ID.\n• Fixed: tapping Record a find again no longer hides your earlier finds.\n• Fewer interruptions asking for extra photos, plus other fixes.",
